        "product_summary": "Clean ankle boot profile: A smooth forefoot and broad stitched side panels create a simple winter footwear silhouette.\nPlush interior: Grey plush lining is visible inside the opened shaft and along the tongue edge.\nMetal lace fittings: Round eyelets and upper lace guides secure the crossed laces, with a tongue keeper and rear pull loop.\nTPR outsole design: Angular lugs sit below a contrasting light-coloured sidewall, visible in the actual underside photographs.\nTwo neutral colourways: Black and Tan are offered in EU 39–47 for wholesale assortment planning.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
